  "id": "perceived-simultaneity",
  "term": "perceived simultaneity",
  "definition": "Perceived simultaneity is the experience of events as happening at the same time. In this context, it is treated not as a single instant but as a brief time window that lets the mind combine different sensory signals into one coherent percept.",
